  ║                                                               ║
  ║  CONTROLS:                                                    ║
  ║  Desktop: WASD move | Mouse aim | Click fire                  ║
  ║    Space jump/glide | F build | R reload | 1-3 weapons       ║
  ║    Q cycle build type | P pause                              ║
  ║  Mobile: Left joystick move | 🔫 fire | 🧱 build            ║
